5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the ground shifting. We need to know if the soil can hold the new structures.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. But also, how do people actually move through here? Data on crossings is vital.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the people who will care for the plants. Who is on the team?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Drawings lie. I want to see the condition of works from the earlier programme.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the ledger. What did the last project actually cost to maintain?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if the ground slips, crossings are useless. We need stability first.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Stability is a prerequisite, Kenji. But without usage data, we design for ghosts.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think the volunteers might help. I want to see who is working with the division.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, the ledger shows spend, not quality. I need the record of the eastern avenue planting.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Quality affects cost, Minako. I will look at the upkeep ledger spend per hectare.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving. Who can actually dig here?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look into the timed counts of weekday crossings. Let the data speak.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services. I want to know the faces.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look at the condition of works from the earlier programme. I want to see the decay.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the terms of the regional habitat fund. I want to see the strings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
