35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The firms say the clay is tricky. They only quote for small work. Big digging is risky.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The data is clear. People walk the hard paths. The soft edges are ignored.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found the roll is very small. Only seven staff. But the volunteers are there.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,The earlier works are failing. The planting died because no one watered it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The fund pays for plants, not paths. The ledger shows plants cost three times more to keep.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, if the planting dies, the whole plan fails. We need simple, hardy things.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, exactly. And the heat makes it worse. The ground gets too hot for delicate roots.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"I am worried. If we plant too much, the seven staff cannot look after it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree. We must judge by what survives, not what is drawn. The last decade shows neglect.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"The finance papers are clear. If we choose heavy planting, the city pays forever.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"So, we need a plan that is easy to build and easy to keep.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,And it must match how people actually walk. No fancy mazes in the way.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The volunteers can help with the simple things. But they cannot fix broken drains.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,I am convinced. We need a plan that has already proven it can last.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am looking for the option that does not bleed money in year three.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
